                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "You've placed the abdominal organs in 3D, applied the peritoneal/retroperitoneal distinction and the aorta/IVC orientation rule, related nodal stations to the great vessels, and seen why motion, filling, and fiducials shape abdominal verification."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
